CLI cases passed: localized help, no README hint, arbitrary MP3 filenames and paths, default and opt-in frame exports.
PTY fixture passed: ready/start, termination, pause, resize, seek, quit, terminal restore, no duplicate requests.
PTY player-failure case passed: full-screen panels at 220x60 / 240x64, real ERROR, no story termination, terminal restored.
PTY loop case passed: repeated exact media seeks, deterministic rebuild, no duplicate requests, terminal restored.
PTY default EOF case passed: immediate finish, one deletion, no Easter-egg event, terminal restored.
PTY default hold case passed: DELETED retained until explicit quit, no implicit Easter egg.
PTY EOF case passed: no early exit, silent pause/resize/resume, one Easter egg, no music replay, automatic finish.
PTY tail-entry case passed: direct post-EOF start, rewind to media, deterministic history, hold final frame, explicit quit.

Frame review: exported 30 deterministic HTML/cell/PNG frames in .cache/v4.4-previews (not committed).
Delivery frames cover 130x35, 160x45, 220x60 in Chinese and English, before and after result delivery attempts.
Inspected PNGs: delivery-cn-130, prediction-en-160, delivery-en-220, count-six, ready-cn, ready-en, delete-pending.
Status and packet animation occupy five rows above the plot; each TX/RX channel has two separate rows below it.
